{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 41,
  "name": "山泽损",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05878",
              "text": "损：有孚，元吉，无咎，可贞，利有攸往。曷之用？二簋可用享。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05878",
                "bodyParagraph": 5814
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05879",
              "text": "【白话】《损卦》象征减损：内心有诚意，最为吉祥，不会招来祸患，可以坚守正道，利于前去行事。用什么祭祀神灵呢？两簋（古代盛食物的器具，圆口，有两个耳子）粗淡的食物就足够了。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05879",
                "bodyParagraph": 5815
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05880",
              "text": "《象》曰：山下有泽，损；君子以惩忿窒欲。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05880",
                "bodyParagraph": 5816
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05881",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：《损卦》的卦象是兑（泽）下艮（山）上，为山下有湖泽之表象，湖泽渐深而高山愈来愈高，象征着减损；按照这一现象中包含的哲理来做人，君子就应该抑制狂怒暴躁的脾性，杜绝世俗的欲望，也就是摒弃格调不高的低级趣味，不断培养高尚的品德。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05881",
                "bodyParagraph": 5817
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "卦义与哲学解读",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05883",
              "text": "损卦艮上兑下，山下有泽，象征有所减损，也提醒人在损益之间权衡。卦辞以诚为本：“有孚，元吉，无咎，可贞；利有攸往。”《象》特别强调“惩忿窒欲”，先减少愤怒与欲望，才谈助人和增益。损并不是一味伤害自己，而是适度投入、克制贪婪、在必要时让利；少损而得长远之益。经商应精算投入产出，不可投机欺诈；事业合作要量力而为。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05883",
                "bodyParagraph": 5819
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05886",
              "text": "初九，已事遄往，无咎；酌损之。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05886",
                "bodyParagraph": 5822
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05887",
              "text": "【白话】初九，停下正在做的事情赶快前去助人，就不会有灾难临头，损己助人时要再三斟酌把握分寸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05887",
                "bodyParagraph": 5823
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05888",
              "text": "《象》曰：“已事遄往”，尚合志也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05888",
                "bodyParagraph": 5824
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05889",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“停下正在做的事情赶快前去助人”，处在尊位的柔弱之辈正需要帮助，地位卑下的陽刚之士首当其冲，义不容辞，立刻牺牲自己的事业而成人之美，表现出尊贵者心心相印的关系。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05889",
                "bodyParagraph": 5825
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05891",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05891",
                "bodyParagraph": 5827
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05893",
              "text": "初九爻动，变为第4卦《蒙卦》（山水蒙）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05893",
                "bodyParagraph": 5829
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05895",
              "text": "初九“已事遄往，无咎，酌损之”：办妥手头事务，及时援助他人，但应斟酌力所能及的减损。善意不等于无限付出。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05895",
                "bodyParagraph": 5831
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "九二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05898",
              "text": "九二，利贞，征凶；弗损益之。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05898",
                "bodyParagraph": 5834
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05899",
              "text": "【白话】九二，利于坚守正道，主动出击会有凶险；几乎用不着自我减损就可以使尊贵者受益。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05899",
                "bodyParagraph": 5835
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05900",
              "text": "《象》曰：九二利贞，中以为志也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05900",
                "bodyParagraph": 5836
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05901",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：《损卦》的第二爻位（九二）之所以利于坚守正道，是因为处在不高不下的适中位置上，本身地位又不很稳固，不宜于积极行动。只有持不偏不激也不过于保守的中庸态度，作为始终不变的志向，才能够使他人受益。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05901",
                "bodyParagraph": 5837
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05903",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05903",
                "bodyParagraph": 5839
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05905",
              "text": "九二爻动，变为第27卦《颐卦》（山雷颐）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05905",
                "bodyParagraph": 5841
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05907",
              "text": "九二“利贞，征凶；弗损，益之”强调守中而不要逞强。自身能力有限时，盲目行动反有危险；不必自损才能实现适当帮助。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05907",
                "bodyParagraph": 5843
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "六三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05910",
              "text": "六三，三人行，则损一人；一人行，则得其友。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05910",
                "bodyParagraph": 5846
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05911",
              "text": "【白话】六三，三个人一同前进，由于互相掣肘会使一个人受到伤害；一个人独自行动，就会专心一意地寻求伙伴，最终必定能遇到志同道合的朋友。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05911",
                "bodyParagraph": 5847
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05912",
              "text": "《象》曰：一人行，三则疑也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05912",
                "bodyParagraph": 5848
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05913",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：一个人前去无牵无挂，目的明确，可以顺利地得到接应，取得成功。三个人一齐前去，则会相互猜疑而达不到预期的目的。说明损下益上不能不分情况地一窝蜂上，而要审时度势，讲求实效。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05913",
                "bodyParagraph": 5849
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05915",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05915",
                "bodyParagraph": 5851
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05917",
              "text": "六三爻动，变为第26卦《大畜卦》（山天大畜）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05917",
                "bodyParagraph": 5853
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05919",
              "text": "六三“三人行，则损一人；一人行，则得其友”，提醒合作需要信任与清晰分工，人数并非越多越好。过度复杂反易生疑。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05919",
                "bodyParagraph": 5855
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "六四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05922",
              "text": "六四，损其疾，使遄有喜。无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05922",
                "bodyParagraph": 5858
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05923",
              "text": "【白话】六四，尽量减损克服自身的弱点，准备迎接马上到来的喜庆，不会有任何灾祸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05923",
                "bodyParagraph": 5859
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05924",
              "text": "《象》曰：“损其疾”，亦可喜也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05924",
                "bodyParagraph": 5860
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05925",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“尽量减损克服自身的弱点”，意思是说，本身很柔弱，又处在比较尊贵的地位上，不可能通过自我减损来使他人受益。只有尽量减损克服自身的弱点，等待接受别人助益。但无论哪种减损，哪怕是这种减损克服自身弱点的举动，也是十分可喜的事情。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05925",
                "bodyParagraph": 5861
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05927",
              "text": "平。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05927",
                "bodyParagraph": 5863
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05929",
              "text": "六四爻动，变为第38卦《睽卦》（火泽睽）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05929",
                "bodyParagraph": 5865
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05931",
              "text": "六四“损其疾，使遄有喜，无咎”，可以理解为迅速减除自身弊病、弱点或妨碍，方可迎来转机。占辞亦以疾病减轻为喜，不能作为医学疗效预测。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05931",
                "bodyParagraph": 5867
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "六五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05934",
              "text": "六五，或益之十朋之龟，弗克违，元吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05934",
                "bodyParagraph": 5870
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05935",
              "text": "【白话】六五，有人送来价值十朋（古时候货币单位，双贝为一朋）的大宝龟，想推辞都不行，大吉大利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05935",
                "bodyParagraph": 5871
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05936",
              "text": "《象》曰：六五元吉，自上佑也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05936",
                "bodyParagraph": 5872
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05937",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：《损卦》的第五爻位（六五）之所以获得大吉大利，完全是上天保佑的结果。因为六五爻本身陰柔，居于尊位，仍想着自我减损而使他人受益。这样不但得到大众的广泛助益，也博得了上天的好感。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05937",
                "bodyParagraph": 5873
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05939",
              "text": "吉。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05939",
                "bodyParagraph": 5875
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05941",
              "text": "六五爻动，变为第61卦《中孚卦》（风泽中孚）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05941",
                "bodyParagraph": 5877
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05943",
              "text": "六五“或益之，十朋之龟，弗克违，元吉”，取贵重灵龟赠予为象，强调因谦虚、诚信与长久付出而得到外来助益。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05943",
                "bodyParagraph": 5879
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05946",
              "text": "上九，弗损益之；无咎，贞吉，有攸往，得臣无家。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05946",
                "bodyParagraph": 5882
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05947",
              "text": "【白话】上九，用不着自我减损就可以使他人受益；没有一点灾患，占卜的结果十分吉利，前去行事，定能获得天下万民归心。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05947",
                "bodyParagraph": 5883
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05948",
              "text": "《象》曰：“弗损益之”，大得志也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05948",
                "bodyParagraph": 5884
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-05949",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“用不着自我减损就可以使他人受益”，是因为处在损卦最高位置，损极必反，本身所获取的大量的助益，使得能够不用自我减损就可以有益他人，这当然是损卦损己益人的最高境界，因而使得损己益人的心意得到极大的满足。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05949",
                "bodyParagraph": 5885
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05951",
              "text": "吉。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05951",
                "bodyParagraph": 5887
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05953",
              "text": "上九爻动，变为第19卦《临卦》（地泽临）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05953",
                "bodyParagraph": 5889
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-05955",
              "text": "上九“弗损益之”，追求不使人受害而能使人有益的境界。得臣无家之说，指获得无私、愿意协助大众的人；此时守正往行有利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-05955",
                "bodyParagraph": 5891
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 0
}
